        01012      5,00   71214 COMPARE.EMPLOYEE.NUMBERS.  GO TO COMPUTE.PAY WHEN DETAIL EMPLOYNO
        01013                         IS EQUAL TO MASTER EMPLOYNO, LOW.DETAIL WHEN DETAIL
        01014                         EMPLOYNO IS LESS THAN MASTER EMPLOYNO.
        01015      6,00   71215 HIGH.DETAIL.  MOVE 'M' TO MASTER ERRORCODE, FILE MASTER IN
        01016                         ERROR.FILE.
        01017      7,00                 GET MASTER, AT END DO END.OF.MASTERS.
        01018      8,00                 GO TO COMPARE.EMPLOYEE.NUMBERS.
        02001      9,00   71220 LOW.DETAIL.  MOVE 'D' TO DETAIL ERRORCODE, FILE DETAIL IN
        02002                         ERROR.FILE.
        02003     10,00                 GO TO GET.DETAIL.
        02004     11,00   71221 END.OF.MASTERS.  IF DETAIL EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE THEN GO TO
        02005                         END.OF.RUN OTHERWISE SET MASTER EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE.
        02006     12,00   71224 END.OF.DETAILS.  IF MASTER EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE THEN GO TO
        02007                         END.OF.RUN OTHERWISE SET DETAIL EMPLOYNO = HIGH.VALUE, GO
        02008                         TO COMPARE.EMPLOYEE.NUMBERS.
        02009     13,00   71227 END.OF.RUN.  MOVE CORRESPONDING GRAND.TOTAL TO PAYRECORD, FILE
        02010                         PAYRECORD, CLOSE ALL FILES.
        02011     14,00                 STOP 1234.
        02012     15,00   71230 COMPUTE.PAY.  IF DETAIL HOURS IS GREATER THAN 40 THEN SET DETAIL
        02013                         GROSS = (DETAIL HOURS - 40) * MASTER RATE * 1.5.
        02014     16,00                 SET DETAIL GROSS = DETAIL GROSS + MASTER RATE * 40, DO
        02015                         FICA.ROUTINE, DO WITHOLDING.TAX.ROUTINE.
        02016     17,00                 IF MASTER BONDEDUCT IS NOT EQUAL TO ZERO THEN DO
        02017                         BOND.ROUTINE.
        02018     18,00                 DO SEARCH FOR INDEX = 1(1)12.
        02019     19,00   71233 NET.    SET PAYRECORD NETPAY = DETAIL GROSS - DETAIL FICA - DETAIL
        02020                         WHT - DETAIL RETIREMENT - DETAIL INSURANCE - DETAIL
        02021                         BONDEDUCT.
        03001     20,00                 ADD CORRESPONDING DETAIL TOTALS TO MASTER TOTALS, MOVE
        03002                         CORRESPONDING DETAIL TO PAYRECORD, CHECK, MOVE PAYRECORD
        03003                         NETPAY TO CHECK AMOUNT.
        03004     21,00                 FILE CHECK.
        03005     22,00                 IF PAYRECORD DEPARTMENT IS GREATER THAN CURRENT DEPARTMENT
        03006                         THEN MOVE BLANKS TO PAYRECORD EMPLOYNO, PAYRECORD NAME,
        03007                         MOVE CORRESPONDING DEPARTMENT.TOTAL TO PAYRECORD, FILE
        03008                         PAYRECORD, MOVE ZEROS TO DPT HOURS, DPT GROSS, DPT WHT,
        03009                         DPT FICA, DPT BONDEDUCT, DPT INSPREM, DPT RETPREM, DPT
        03010                         NETPAY, DPT BONDPURCHASES.
        03011     23,00                 MOVE CORRESPONDING DETAIL TO PAYRECORD, CURRENT,  ADD
        03012                         CORRESPONDING DETAIL TO DEPARTMENT.TOTAL, GRAND.TOTAL,
        DATE 06/01/60  TIME  1.00  ACCOUNT                     ID.                         PAGE  2

        03013                         FILE PAYRECORD.
        03014     24,00                 GO TO GET.MASTER.
        03015     25,00   71235 FICA.ROUTINE.  BEGIN SECTION.
        03016     26,00                 IF MASTER FICA + 0.03 * DETAIL GROSS IS LESS THAN 144.00
        03017                         THEN SET DETAIL FICA = 0.03 * DETAIL GROSS  OTHERWISE SET
        03018                         DETAIL FICA = 144.00 - MASTER FICA.
        03019     27,00                 ADD DETAIL FICA TO MASTER FICA.
        03020     28,00         GN)016END FICA.ROUTINE.
        04001     29,00   71241 WITHOLDING.TAX.ROUTINE.  BEGIN SECTION.
        04002     30,00                 IF 13 * MASTER EXEMPTIONS IS LESS THAN DETAIL GROSS THEN
        04003                         SET DETAIL WHT = 0.18 * (DETAIL GROSS - 13 * MASTER
        04004                         EXEMPTIONS) OTHERWISE SET DETAIL WHT = ZEROS.
        04005     31,00                 ADD DETAIL WHT TO MASTER WHT.
        04006     32,00         GN)019END WITHOLDING.TAX.ROUTINE.
        04007     33,00   71245 BOND.ROUTINE.  BEGIN SECTION.
        04008     34,00                 ADD MASTER BONDEDUCT TO MASTER BONDACCUM.
        04009     35,00   71246 BOND.CALCULATION.  IF MASTER BONDENOM IS NOT GREATER THAN MASTER
        04010                         BONDACCUM THEN SET MASTER BONDACCUM = MASTER BONDACCUM -
        04011                         MASTER BONDENOM OTHERWISE GO TO BOND.END.
        04012     36,00                 MOVE CORRESPONDING MASTER TO BONDORDER, ADD BONDORDER
        04013                         BONDENOM TO DPT BONDPURCHASES, MOVE BONDORDER BONDENOM TO
        04014                         PAYRECORD BONDENOM, FILE BONDORDER IN ERROR.FILE.
        04015     37,00                 GO TO BOND.CALCULATION.
        04016     38,00   71251 BOND.END.  END BOND.ROUTINE.
        04017     39,00   71252 SEARCH.  BEGIN SECTION.
        04018     40,00                 IF MASTER RATE GT TABLE.ITEM RATE (INDEX) THEN GO TO
        04019                         SEARCH.END OTHERWISE ADD TABLE.ITEM INSPREM (INDEX) TO
        04020                         DETAIL INSURANCE, ADD TABLE.ITEM RETPREM (INDEX) TO DETAIL
        04021                         RETIREMENT, GO TO NET.
        04022     41,00   71255 SEARCH.END.  END SEARCH.

